   GV4's own written acceptance criterion — "rendered strings equal
   templates.FormatMoney of the year-0 GuardrailCutTrigger/
   GuardrailRaiseTrigger"). GV2's buildGuardrailChartSummary computes its
   "today" figure as last.GuardrailCutTrigger / last.CumulativeInflation;
